                                "sense_id": "6a126a50-cdf8-3846-8309-36602debe9c3",
                                "text": "In the legend of the Trojan War, Ajax was king of Salamis and son of Telamon. After Achilles, he was the bravest Greek warrior at Troy. In Homer's epic poem the Iliad, Ajax engages in many combats for..."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
